）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220426/595694382461620224839705.jpeg/BgZJ_m-dO40dMcSAvEcxnUpKTwBHVdIPqj3056o99Oc\"/><figcaption>辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220426/595694354161471488820913.jpeg/Z-mkwyhnPfUj41akuv-w96PRBfBzEPDD--mfk_vpn5M\"/><figcaption>辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220426/595694357013729280138247.jpeg/vw018ZQNjGGOKBJmsggwAASmxkRiIOdWvKTKW7ykyls\"/><figcaption>辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220426/595694359614328832379528.jpeg/miLxj9SdC5Wdzu1hob9nxjOgHkdY_3V6Dj852w4_Ods\"/><figcaption>辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220426/595694362298814464736190.jpeg/9c878Sdm_yb0fVIKvkQUesSlL3AN2_FM0glQWtIJUFo\"/><figcaption>辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220426/595694364958134272375190.jpeg/ae5uLFjBdQpVuTp7PbSDyuT_umpxORnuOrrPEzq6zxM\"/><figcaption>辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220426/595694367315464192290654.jpeg/rPq2LxECYzXLIL_A26VWMkuzTKqBcZ6NdpUuzXaVLs0\"/><figcaption>辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>中國職場人情世故在香港不管用？赴港8年網紅解析4大職場差異</p><p>壽司郎員工教育板被挖出！「引爆語」越看越熟 網笑：學起來上班不內耗</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:46.892438+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1906,"images":36,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:00:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:26.1